flowchart TD
  A[Initialize with machine and input] --> B{Definition and input valid?}
  B -- No --> ERR[ERROR and block execution]
  B -- Yes --> C{Already in halting state?}
  C -- Accept --> ACC[ACCEPTED]
  C -- Reject --> REJ[REJECTED]
  C -- No --> D{Budget exhausted?}
  D -- Yes --> LIM[STEP LIMIT REACHED]
  D -- No --> E[Read state and tape symbol]
  E --> F{Transition exists?}
  F -- No --> STUCK[STUCK]
  F -- Yes --> G[Write symbol]
  G --> H[Move L R or S]
  H --> I[Update state and step count]
  I --> J[Record complete snapshot]
  J --> C
